code_snippet:
SELECT e.eid, d.name
FROM Emp e
INNER JOIN Dept d ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id;

SELECT e.eid, d.name
FROM Emp e
FULL OUTER JOIN Dept d ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id;

stem_en:
Table dhaka(nid) holds 1, 2, 3, 3 and table ctg(nid) holds 3, 4. How many rows do these two queries return?

Q1: SELECT nid FROM dhaka UNION SELECT nid FROM ctg;
Q2: SELECT nid FROM dhaka UNION ALL SELECT nid FROM ctg;

